{"synopsis":"[Seo Hoyun, selamat! Anda terpilih sebagai pemain dalam *Underrated Idol Tycoon*!] Seorang PD brengsek yang dibenci semua orang tiba-tiba menjadi idol tak dikenal di dunia paralel. Satu-satunya orang yang masih mengingatnya sepenuhnya hanyalah adiknya. Untuk kembali ke dunia asalnya, ia harus menjadi idol papan atas dan menyelesaikan permainan ini! “…Terima quest.” “Kamu gila?” “Aku juga perlu makan untuk bertahan hidup.” Keahliannya adalah mengancam, hobinya membujuk. Kisah survival idol dari seorang PD kejam yang tak kenal takut!","alternative_title":"The Trashy PD Has To Survive as an Idol, Surviving as a Crazy Idol PD, 망나니 PD 아이돌로 살아남기","author":"Moonzzin, Space Potato","artist":"HUBAE","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"60f896c1-fb61-4c9c-be6e-4f83b75e0032","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7ea10671-2cc4-4f8f-a034-c95797dd761b","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ba49aacf-5367-4e79-93f9-55e677464ac0","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-06-20","released":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a6f58bb2-f1b6-4364-b43c-291b07264133","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7c00f2a2-b647-41f1-8272-d02811c68598","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-06-07","released":"2026-06-07","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"794bd4e4-9e28-44c3-b043-be43db2a4f79","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-05-30","released":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"04d3cd97-e185-4fc4-9d90-23cf1a8c4e78","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-05-17","released":"2026-05-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c543930c-fe61-4694-bbda-59a2ad25363d","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-05-10","released":"2026-05-10","images"